    "items.new/1#4": {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "I proposed two actions for review rev_401. Both need human approval, and neither has run yet.\n\n- **Review rev_401** (1 star, Bruno Díaz, order PC-1058, stale Colombia bag): I proposed a public reply that thanks him, apologises and owns the problem. It reuses the wording Alice approved for the similar review rev_421, so I followed that precedent.\n- **Coupon:** I looked Bruno up through his order, since the event only gave a customer ID. His email is bruno@example.com. He has no earlier coupons or refunds. I proposed a 15% coupon for him.\n\nI didn't propose a refund, since the instructions don't cover one. The run now waits for people to decide on both proposals.",
        "signature": null,
        "phase": null,
        "metadata": {
            "finish_reason": {
