                "content": "The coupon went out, and the public reply was rejected.\n\n- **Coupon:** The 15% coupon POLAR-5D2870 was emailed to bruno@example.com.\n- **Duplicate coupon:** Bruno's customer record already showed a 15% coupon for the same review, POLAR-EAAC40, issued at 04:57:39. That was before my proposal. He now has two 15% coupons for the same complaint. You may want to void one.\n- **Public reply:** The reply to rev_401 was rejected with the note \"Not this time.\" No reason was given. I won't re-propose it or draft a new version unless you ask. The review stays unanswered for now.\n\nI made no other proposals.",
